# Mounted official electronic-invoice validator artifacts (FeRD/FNFE, KoSIT).
# PVAD ships none of these: an operator mounts a reviewed set at one of these paths and the
# validator reads it locally. They must never be committed - their redistribution terms are the
# open licence question the whole conformance gate is waiting on.
validator-artifacts/
/deploy/**/validator-artifacts/

